  "meta": {"motion": "static", "death": {"kind": "structure", "ticks": 7}, "doc": "Dock (3x3): warehouse with roll-up door, quay deck with fenders and bollards, slip ramp, jib crane (SLIDE_Y hook) with a blinking light. The water side is +Z (must be placed on the shoreline)."},
